<div class="rules-wrap" id="rule_builder_${elId}" data-id-class="${idClass}" style="display:none; min-width: 500px; height: 230px; overflow: auto; margin-bottom: 11px;">
	Initially <select name="initial_display[${itemId}]"><option value="visible">visible</option><option value="hidden">hidden</option></select>,
	and then toggle when <span class="ruletype">all</span> of these rules match:
	<div class="search-form ruletype-all">
		<div class="rule-list"></div>
		<div class="term"><span class="add-term">+</span> Add a new rule</div>
	</div>
	<br />
	and when <span class="ruletype">any</span> of these rules match:
	<div class="search-form ruletype-any">
		<div class="rule-list"></div>
		<div class="term"><span class="add-term">+</span> Add a new rule</div>
	</div>
</div>